<title>FINLAND: YLEISELEKTRONIIKKA CORRECTS 6-MTH EPS.</title>
<headline>YLEISELEKTRONIIKKA CORRECTS 6-MTH EPS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish electronics components</p>
<p>maker Yleiselektroniikka Oy on Monday corrected its</p>
<p>April-September earnings per share (EPS) to 1.10 markka from</p>
<p>2.10 markka reported on Friday.</p>
<p>The April-September 1995 EPS was 2.10 as reported earlier.</p>
<p>					 Six months to end-September, 1996</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items	    2.6 vs 3.7</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   1.10 vs 2.10</p>
<p> Net sales					   47.5 vs 48.6</p>
<p> Operating profit				   2.6 vs 3.7</p>
<p> Depreciation					 1.6 vs 1.4</p>
<p> Net financial items				nil vs nil</p>
<p> Extraordinary items			 gain 1.3 vs nil</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, taxes	  3.9 vs 3.7</p>
<p>NOTES - Full name of electronics components maker and</p>
<p>		importer is Yleiselektroniikka Oy.</p>
<p>	    - Company said it expected its second half result to</p>
<p>		have a similar developement as the first half.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0245</p>
</text>
